    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Opens the menu list under administration" id="test-1">
            <p>Ensures the main sidebar is pinned and the Administration menu is expanded before each scenario.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <step>Visit /main/dashboard.</step>
            <step>If the unpin icon is visible in the sidebar, click it to pin the menu.</step>
            <step>Click the Administration menu.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Administration menu is visible and ready for interaction.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
